1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,130
Man: Are you going to the book club meeting tonight?

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,240
Woman: I haven't finished the book yet.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,192
Man: That's OK! And yeah, Jake Homgren's novels can be a slog sometimes.

4
00:00:09,192 --> 00:00:12,240
But the philosophical insights in them are fascinating.

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,071
Woman: Maybe if I hear other club members' perspectives,

6
00:00:15,071 --> 00:00:19,160
it'll help me follow the book better and make the reading go faster.

7
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:24,190
Man: This was exactly my experience when we discussed Chen Wang's poems last week.
